# Optional: force the IP that Expo puts into the QR / connection URL.
# Use your Mac's Wi‑Fi address so the iPhone on the same LAN can reach Metro.
#
#   REACT_NATIVE_PACKAGER_HOSTNAME=192.168.1.23
#   npm run start:lan
#
# Leave unset to let Expo auto-detect the LAN IP.
# REACT_NATIVE_PACKAGER_HOSTNAME=
